Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 14:32:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: KIVI INT4 triton kernel with attention and worker
 integration

- Refactor kivi_cache triton kernel for better Ascend compatibility
  (tl.floor(x+0.5) replace tl.round for half-up rounding)
- Integrate KIVI INT4 cache into attention_v1 and model_runner
- Add KIVI cache support in worker v2 pipeline
- Hook up attn_utils, input_batch, model_states for KIVI path

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
